    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10627" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιτῠπ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strike against,</i> esp. of a hard body, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mete.</u>
					370b18
				</span></i>
			; <i>resist,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἁπτὰ ἀ. τὴν ἁφήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Sign.</u>
					18
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεδίου μὴ ἀντιτυποῦντος τῇ ὁπλῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Dom.</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσάλληλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ach.Tat.
					2.38
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.177
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ εἶκον καὶ μὴ ἀντιτυποῦν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Cra.</u>
					420d
				</span></i>
			:—also in 
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.61
			</span></i>.</div>
